#. type: Plain text
#: data/man/github-l10n.1:8
msgid ""
"B<github-l10n> is a GTK4/Adwaita application that scans popular open-source "
"GitHub repositories and shows which ones have or lack translations for a "
"given language. It searches for .po, .ts, and .xliff files, supports "
"filtering by translation status, drill-down to specific files, optional "
"GitHub token for higher rate limits, and local caching."
msgstr ""

